#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "The calling process does not have the B<CAP_SYS_ADMIN> capability."
msgstr "Le processus appelant n'a pas la capacité B<CAP_SYS_ADMIN>."

